  "contracts": [
    "Select index opcodes from the actual lowered register; preserve held assignment ordering and exact wide keys.",
    "Preserve negative string-byte positions and fixed SIMD transpose/vector storage contracts.",
    "Preserve C declaration ownership, token groups, anonymous members, trailing attributes and ordinary Clang refusal/fallback.",
    "Dispatch semantic indexed stores through absent-key __newindex, including record declarations and array holes; retain rawset, occupied stores, sparse maps, GC, handler errors and reentry.",
    "Preserve explicit/inferred/gradual/absent type-call provenance; keep stage-zero and sparse-indexer rules unchanged."
  ],
